    class="about-photo">
  <div class="about-text">
    <h1>Juneon Kim</h1>
    <p class="about-role">3D Environment Artist &middot; Technical Artist</p>
    <p>
      I am a passionate 3D Environment Artist and recent graduate with a strong foundation in hard-surface
      modeling, PBR texturing, and real-time rendering. My journey into 3D graphics began with a fascination 
      for the unique intersection of art and technology. As someone who loves diving into new tech and software, 
      becoming an Environment Artist was the natural path—it's the exact sweet spot where my artistic creativity 
      and technical problem-solving meet. 
    </p>
    <p>
      Throughout my projects, I have developed a comprehensive pipeline that takes scenes from initial concept to 
      final polish. My technical expertise spans hard-surface modeling, environment layout, and set dressing, 
      alongside detailed PBR texturing and look development. Whether I am building complex shader networks, setting 
      up atmospheric lighting, or optimizing assets for real-time rendering, I take pride in ensuring every 
      environment is both visually stunning and technically sound.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

